OL,3,AWonky elm named UK Tree of the Year
OL,4,
OL,5,FA "bendy" wych elm has been crowned the
OL,6,FUK's Tree of the Year 2026 - the first
OL,7,Ftime a tree in Northern Ireland has won
OL,8,Fthe title.
OL,10,FThe 150-year-old tree on the central
OL,11,Fpromenade in Newcastle, County Down
OL,12,Ftook more than 30% of the national
OL,13,Fpublic vote.
OL,15,FThe theme of the Woodland Trust's
OL,16,Fannual competition was Against All
OL,17,FOdds, with trees across the UK
OL,18,Fshortlisted for being impressive,
OL,19,Fbeautiful and sometimes baffling
OL,20,Fexamples of how nature can survive
OL,21,Fadversity.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
