OL,3,AWonky elm named UK Tree of the Year
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe trust's Northern Ireland director
OL,6,FJohn Martin said he had been rooting
OL,7,Ffor the "whimsical" tree to win and
OL,8,Fsaid tens of thousands of people across
OL,9,Fthe UK had clearly felt the same.
